      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To mask communication cadence, implement a deliberately varied, asynchronous messaging rhythm rather than predictable clusters of activity. Protocol should mandate \"chaff\" transmissions—low-priority, routine messages sent randomly to mimic background noise. This statistical obfuscation makes pattern recognition extremely difficult for external monitoring systems.",
